body:
The eslint-disable comment omits `configPanelOpen` from the dependency array without clear justification. While the pattern appears intentional (clearing editSchema only when metadata refreshes and panel is already closed), this creates a potential stale closure issue. If `configPanelOpen` is stale when the effect runs, the effect might incorrectly clear editSchema while the panel is actually open, or fail to clear it when closed. Consider including `configPanelOpen` in the dependency array, or add a clear comment explaining why the stale closure is safe in this specific case.
```suggestion
  }, [dashboard, configPanelOpen]);
```
